#. ~ Description of effect 'Grabbed'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You have been grabbed by an attack.\n"
"You are being held in place, and dodging is harder."
msgstr ""
"무언가의 공격으로 붙잡혔습니다.\n"
"당신은 제자리에 고정되어 있으며 회피가 더 어려워집니다."

#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Grabbing"
msgstr "붙잡음"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Grabbing'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Grabbing another creature and holding them in place."
msgstr "다른 생물을 붙잡아 제자리에 고정시켰습니다."

#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Lacking Sleep"
msgstr "수면 부족"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Lacking Sleep'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You haven't slept in a while, and it shows."
msgstr "한동안 잠을 자지 못했고, 이제 그 부작용이 나타나기 시작합니다."

#. ~ Apply message for effect(s) 'Lacking Sleep'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You are too physically tired to function well."
msgstr "온몸이 너무 피곤해서 뭔가 제대로 하기가 어렵습니다."

#. ~ Miss message for effect(s) 'Lacking Sleep'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You don't have energy to fight."
msgstr "싸울 힘이 없습니다."

#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You lie down to go to sleep..."
msgstr "잠들기 위해 누웠습니다..."

#: data/json/effects.json src/mutation_data.cpp
msgid "You fall asleep."
msgstr "잠들었습니다."

#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You wake up."
msgstr "잠에서 깨어났습니다."

#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Under operation"
msgstr "수술중"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Under operation'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You are being operated on.  Try to stay still."
msgstr "수술을 받고 있습니다. 움직이지 마세요."

#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Playing an instrument"
msgstr "악기 연주중"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Playing an instrument'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You're playing an instrument.\n"
"Focusing on playing music distracts you, slowing you down."
msgstr ""
"악기를 연주하고 있습니다.\n"
"연주에 힘을 쏟는 것은 집중력과 속도를 떨어뜨립니다."

#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Corroding"
msgstr "부식"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Corroding'.
#. ~ Apply message for effect(s) 'Corroding'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You're covered in acid!"
msgstr "산에 뒤덮였습니다!"

#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Zapped"
msgstr "감전됨"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Zapped'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You've been zapped with electricity and are barely able to move!"
msgstr "감전되어 움직일 수가 없습니다!"

#. ~ Apply message for effect(s) 'Zapped'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You're zapped!"
msgstr "감전되었습니다!"

#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Hypocalcemia"
msgstr "칼슘부족"

#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Weak bones"
msgstr "약해진 뼈"

#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Brittle bones"
msgstr "심하게 약해진 뼈"

#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"A lack of calcium in your diet will make your bones progressively weaker."
msgstr "식단에 칼슘이 부족해 점차적으로 뼈가 약해질 것입니다."

#. ~ Apply message for effect(s) 'Hypocalcemia, Weak bones, Brittle bones'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your bones are becoming more brittle."
msgstr "뼈가 점점 약해지고 있습니다."

#. ~ Remove message for effect(s) 'Hypocalcemia, Weak bones, Brittle bones'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your bones regain their usual strength."
msgstr "뼈가 정상 강도를 되찾았습니다."

#. ~ Decay message for effect(s) 'Hypocalcemia, Weak bones, Brittle bones'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your calcium deficiency is nearly resolved."
msgstr "칼슘 부족이 거의 다 나았습니다."

#. ~ Decay message for effect(s) 'Hypocalcemia, Weak bones, Brittle bones'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your bones become stronger as your calcium deficiency improves."
msgstr "칼슘 부족이 호전되며 뼈가 단단해지고 있습니다."

#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Iron deficiency"
msgstr "철분 결핍"

#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Early anemia"
msgstr "가벼운 빈혈"

#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Anemia"
msgstr "빈혈"

#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"A lack of iron in your diet will result in progressively worsening anemia."
msgstr "식단에 철분이 부족해, 점차 빈혈이 심해질 것입니다."

#. ~ Apply message for effect(s) 'Iron deficiency, Early anemia, Anemia'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You begin feeling increasingly tired and listless."
msgstr "점점 힘이 빠지고 피곤해집니다."

#. ~ Remove message for effect(s) 'Iron deficiency, Early anemia, Anemia'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You no longer feel anemic."
msgstr "더이상 빈혈기가 느껴지지 않습니다."

#. ~ Decay message for effect(s) 'Iron deficiency, Early anemia, Anemia'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your iron deficiency is nearly resolved."
msgstr "철분 부족이 거의 해결되었습니다."

#. ~ Decay message for effect(s) 'Iron deficiency, Early anemia, Anemia'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your feel stronger as your anemia starts to improve."
msgstr "빈혈이 나아지자 힘이 샘솟는 것이 느껴집니다."

#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "VitA deficiency"
msgstr "비타민A 결핍"

#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Poor vision"
msgstr "시력나쁨"

#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Night blindness"
msgstr "야맹증"

#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"A lack of vitamin A in your diet will progressively worsen your vision."
msgstr "식단에 비타민 A가 부족해, 점차 시력이 나빠질 것입니다."

#. ~ Apply message for effect(s) 'VitA deficiency, Poor vision, Night
#. blindness'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You start struggling to make out the finer details."
msgstr "눈이 침침해서 정교한 작업을 하기 힘듭니다."

#. ~ Remove message for effect(s) 'VitA deficiency, Poor vision, Night
#. blindness'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your normal visual acuity returns."
msgstr "시력이 회복되었습니다."

#. ~ Decay message for effect(s) 'VitA deficiency, Poor vision, Night
#. blindness'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your vitamin A deficiency is nearly resolved."
msgstr "비타민 A 결핍이 거의 다 나았습니다."

#. ~ Decay message for effect(s) 'VitA deficiency, Poor vision, Night
#. blindness'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your vision improves as your Vitamin A deficiency improves."
msgstr "비타민 A 결핍이 호전되면서 시력이 돌아오고 있습니다."

#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "B12 deficiency"
msgstr "비타민 B12 부족"

#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Slow healing"
msgstr "혈액응고 지연"

#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "No healing"
msgstr "차도 없음"

#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "A lack of vitamin B12 in your diet will affect your ability to heal."
msgstr "식단에 비타민 B12가 부족해, 상처 회복이 느려질 것입니다."

#. ~ Apply message for effect(s) 'B12 deficiency, Slow healing, No healing'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Simple wounds are starting to concern you more than usual."
msgstr "간단한 상처도 평소보다 더 위험해집니다."

#. ~ Remove message for effect(s) 'B12 deficiency, Slow healing, No healing'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your wounds now heal normally."
msgstr "이제 부상이 다시금 정상적인 속도로 회복됩니다."

#. ~ Decay message for effect(s) 'B12 deficiency, Slow healing, No healing'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your vitamin B12 deficiency is starting to resolve."
msgstr "비타민 B12 결핍이 거의 다 나았습니다."

#. ~ Decay message for effect(s) 'B12 deficiency, Slow healing, No healing'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your ability to heal returns as your Vitamin B12 deficiency improves."
msgstr "비타민 B12 결핍이 호전되면서 상처 회복 능력이 돌아오고 있습니다."

#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Early scurvy"
msgstr "가벼운 괴혈병"

#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Scurvy"
msgstr "괴혈병"

#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Bad Scurvy"
msgstr "심한 괴혈병"

#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"A lack of vitamin C in your diet will result in progressively worse symptoms"
" of scurvy."
msgstr "식단에 비타민 C가 부족해, 점차적으로 괴혈병 증세가 나타날 것입니다."

#. ~ Apply message for effect(s) 'Early scurvy, Scurvy, Bad Scurvy'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You start to develop symptoms of scurvy."
msgstr "괴혈병 증상이 생겼습니다."

#. ~ Remove message for effect(s) 'Early scurvy, Scurvy, Bad Scurvy'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your scurvy has resolved."
msgstr "괴혈병이 사라졌습니다."

#. ~ Decay message for effect(s) 'Early scurvy, Scurvy, Bad Scurvy'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your vitamin C deficiency is starting to resolve."
msgstr "비타민 C 결핍이 거의 다 나았습니다."

#. ~ Decay message for effect(s) 'Early scurvy, Scurvy, Bad Scurvy'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your scurvy lessens as your Vitamin C deficiency improves."
msgstr "비타민 C 결핍이 호전되면서 괴혈병 증상이 점차 줄어들고 있습니다."

#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Hypervitaminosis"
msgstr "비타민 과잉증"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Hypervitaminosis'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "An excess of vitamins has badly affected your metabolism."
msgstr "비타민 과잉은 신진대사에 악영향을 줍니다."

#. ~ Apply message for effect(s) 'Hypervitaminosis'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your metabolism becomes unstable."
msgstr "신진대사가 불안정해졌다."

#. ~ Remove message for effect(s) 'Hypervitaminosis'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your metabolism becomes more stable."
msgstr "신진대사의 균형이 바로 잡히고 있습니다."

#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Weird feeling"
msgstr "이상한 기분"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Weird feeling'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You don't feel entirely like yourself."
msgstr "내 몸이 내 몸같지가 않습니다."

#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Otherwordly feeling"
msgstr "비현실적인 기분"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Otherwordly feeling'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your feel like you're about to change into something else."
msgstr "당신은 무언가로 변하고 있다는 느낌이 듭니다."

#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Mutagenic cascade"
msgstr "돌연변이 폭풍"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Mutagenic cascade'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Change is coming!"
msgstr "변화가 다가옵니다!"

#. ~ Apply message for effect(s) ', Weird feeling, Otherwordly feeling,
#. Mutagenic cascade'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You feel weird."
msgstr "이상한 기분이 듭니다."

#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Crawling skin"
msgstr "스믈거리는 피부"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Crawling skin'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your body is altering itself occasionally."
msgstr "당신의 몸이 간혹 뒤틀리며 변하고 있습니다."

#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Crawling flesh"
msgstr "스믈거리는 살"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Crawling flesh'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You are mutating."
msgstr "변이하고 있습니다."

#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Twisting flesh"
msgstr "뒤틀리는 살"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Twisting flesh'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You feel your body shifting, mutating into new forms."
msgstr "몸이 뒤틀리며 다른 형태로 변하는 것이 느껴집니다."

#. ~ Apply message for effect(s) 'Crawling skin, Crawling flesh, Twisting
#. flesh'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You start mutating!"
msgstr "변이가 시작됩니다!"

#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Lit up"
msgstr "빛이 남"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Lit up'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You are carrying a light and can't hide well."
msgstr "광원을 소지하고 있어 몸을 숨기기 어려워집니다."

#: data/json/effects.json
msgctxt "physically"
msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "불구"

#. ~ Description of effect '{'ctxt': 'physically', 'str': 'Disabled'}'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"This limb is damaged beyond use and must fully heal to recover.  Using a "
"splint may speed up the process."
msgstr "이 사지는 망가져 쓸 수 없으며, 온전히 치유될 때까지 기다려야 합니다. 부목을 대면 치유 속도가 빨라집니다."

#. ~ Apply message for effect(s) 'Disabled'.
#: data/json/effects.json data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "Your limb breaks!"
msgstr "골절당했습니다!"

#. ~ Remove message for effect(s) 'Disabled'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "The broken limb has mended."
msgstr "부러진 부위가 회복되었습니다."

#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Milked"
msgstr "착유됨"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Milked'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "The creature has been partially or fully milked."
msgstr "이 동물은 일부, 또는 전부 착유되었습니다."

#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Sheared"
msgstr "털 잘림"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Sheared'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "The creature has been fully sheared."
msgstr "이 동물의 털을 베어낸지 얼마 되지 않았습니다."

#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Painkillers"
msgstr "진통제"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Painkillers'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You are under the influence of analgesic substances to relieve pain, but "
"they may numb you a bit."
msgstr "진통제를 복용했고 곧 효과가 나타날 것입니다. 몸이 조금 무감각해집니다."

#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Happy"
msgstr "행복함"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Happy'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Life is good."
msgstr "멋진 삶이야!"

#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Joyful"
msgstr "즐거움"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Joyful'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Oh what a day!  What a lovely day!"
msgstr "좋은 날이야! 정말 끝내주게 좋은 날!"

#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Elated"
msgstr "고양됨"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Elated'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "I'm on top of the world, baby!"
msgstr "내가 세상의 왕이다, 짜식들아!"

#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Unhappy"
msgstr "불행함"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Unhappy'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You are not content with your life."
msgstr "당신은 지금의 삶이 만족스럽지 않습니다."

#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Sad"
msgstr "슬픔"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Sad'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "This is not what you planned for your life."
msgstr "당신은 원래 이러려던 것이 아니었습니다…"

#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Depressed"
msgstr "우울증"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Depressed'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "When will all your suffering end?"
msgstr "이 모든 고난이 언제쯤 끝날까요?"

#. ~ Miss message for effect(s) 'Unhappy, Unhappy, Unhappy, Unhappy, Unhappy,
#. Sad, Sad, Sad, Sad, Sad, Depressed'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "What's the point of fighting?"
msgstr "왜 싸워야 하죠?"

#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Irradiated"
msgstr "방사능 피폭"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Irradiated'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You suffer symptoms of a radiation sickness that weakens your body."
msgstr "방사능 피폭의 영향으로 당신의 몸이 약해지고 있습니다."

#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Stimulants"
msgstr "각성제"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Stimulants'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You're very jittery and pumped up, probably from some stimulants."
msgstr "무척 초조하고 심장이 거칠게 뜁니다. 아마 각성제 탓일겁니다."

#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Depressants"
msgstr "진정제"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Depressants'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You are under the influence of depressants, and in a bit of a daze."
msgstr "진정제의 약효가 들어, 조금 멍해집니다."

#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Stimulant Overdose"
msgstr "각성제 과다복용"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Stimulant Overdose'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You can't sit still as you feel your heart pounding out of your chest.  You "
"probably overdosed on those stims."
msgstr ""
"심장이 금방이라도 가슴에서 튀어나올 것처럼 거칠게 뛰어서, 도저히 가만히 있을 수가 없습니다. 아마 각성제 과용 때문일겁니다."

#. ~ Miss message for effect(s) 'Stimulant Overdose'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You shake with the excess stimulation."
msgstr "각성제 과용 탓에 몸이 떨립니다."

#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Took weak antibiotic"
msgstr "약한 항생제 복용"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Took weak antibiotic'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You consumed mild antibiotic some time ago to fight off infection.\n"
"It doesn't guarantee recovery, but slows down the progression of infection."
msgstr "감염에 대항하기 위해 최근 약한 항생제를 복용했습니다. 회복되리라고 장담은 못하지만, 감염의 진행은 늦춰줄 것입니다."

#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Took antibiotic"
msgstr "항생제 복용"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Took antibiotic'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You consumed antibiotic some time ago to fight off infection.\n"
"The infection is stopped from progressing for the duration and you have a high chance of recovery."
msgstr "감염에 대항하기 위해 최근 항생제를 복용했습니다. 지속 중에 감염이 악화되지 않고, 높은 확률로 회복될겁니다."

#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Took strong antibiotic"
msgstr "강한 항생제 복용"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Took strong antibiotic'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You consumed prescription-grade antibiotic some time ago to fight off infection.\n"
"The progression of infection is reversed and you have a high chance of recovery."
msgstr ""
"감염에 대항하기 위해 최근 전문의약품에 속하는 항생제를 복용했습니다.\n"
"감염 진행이 역전되고, 높은 확률로 회복될겁니다."

#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Panacea"
msgstr "만병통치약"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Panacea'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You feel incredible! You could take on the world!"
msgstr "기분이 끝내줍니다! 이 세상이 당신의 것처럼 느껴져요!"

#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Soothed stomach"
msgstr "진정된 위장"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Soothed stomach'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You are under the effects of a stomach soother."
msgstr "위장약의 약효가 돌고 있습니다."

#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Discharge"
msgstr "방전됨"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Discharge'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You've been recently affected by an electromagnetic pulse."
msgstr "최근에 EMP를 맞은 적이 있습니다."

#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Supercharged"
msgstr "과충전"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Supercharged'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You've been struck by lightning, and feel… different."
msgstr "번개를 맞았는데, 느낌이 좀… 다릅니다."

#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Fused"
msgstr "융합체"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Fused'.
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"AI effect to increase stats after fusing with another critter. 1 stack means"
" one absorbed max_hp."
msgstr "다른 개체와 융합하여 능력치를 증가시키는 AI 효과입니다. 1 중첩은 흡수된 최대 HP 1점을 의미합니다."

#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Stinking air"
msgstr "악취나는 공기"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Stinking air'.
#: data/json/effects.json
