#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Avian Heli Pilot"
msgstr "헬리콥터 조류 조종사"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Avian Heli Pilot"
msgstr "헬리콥터 조류 조종사"

#. ~ Profession (male Avian Heli Pilot) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"When the world ended, you thought your piloting experience would keep you "
"safe.  Then the feathers starting growing out.  You must've poked your nose "
"(wait, beak!?) where it didn't belong during one of your stops to refuel.  "
"At least now you have a backup plan if your ride fails you."
msgstr ""
"세상이 끝장났을 때 당신은 조종사 경험이 살아남는데 도움이 되리라 생각했습니다. 그런데 갑자기 깃털이 자라나기 시작했죠. 연료를 보급하러"
" 낯선 착륙장에 낯짝을 들이밀려고 생각했는데, 이제는 그 낯짝에 부리도 자라났습니다. 뭐, 최소한 추락할 때의 대책이 하나 더 생기긴 "
"했네요."

#. ~ Profession (female Avian Heli Pilot) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"When the world ended, you thought your piloting experience would keep you "
"safe.  Then the feathers starting growing out.  You must've poked your nose "
"(wait, beak!?) where it didn't belong during one of your stops to refuel.  "
