msgstr "캣대디"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Crazy Cat Lady"
msgstr "캣맘"

#. ~ Profession (male Crazy Cat Dude) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Everyone is dead?  Well, it doesn't matter… your cats are all the friends "
"you need!"
msgstr "다들 죽었어요? 뭐 상관없죠… 당신의 고양이만 있으면 충분해요!"

