#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Castaway"
msgstr "조난자"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Castaway"
msgstr "조난자"

#. ~ Profession (male Castaway) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were shipwrecked out on an island in the lake.  No one sent a search "
"party, so after weeks of trying to signal for help you salvaged every scrap "
"of clothing you could to set sail on a makeshift raft.  Where is everyone, "
"and why do the sharks look so hungry?"
msgstr ""
"당신은 호수 안의 어느 섬에 조난당했습니다. 아무도 구조대를 보내지 않았고, 몇 주 동안 구조 신호를 보내던 당신은 결국 구할 수 있는 "
"온갖 천쪼가리를 이용해 허술한 뗏목을 만들어야 했습니다. 다들 대체 어디로 간거죠? 그리고 상어들이 왜 이렇게 배고파하는걸까요?"

#. ~ Profession (female Castaway) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were shipwrecked out on an island in the lake.  No one sent a search "
"party, so after weeks of trying to signal for help you salvaged every scrap "
"of clothing you could to set sail on a makeshift raft.  Where is everyone, "
"and why do the sharks look so hungry?"
msgstr ""
