#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Zoo Keeper"
msgstr "동물원 사육사"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Zoo Keeper"
msgstr "동물원 사육사"

#. ~ Profession (male Zoo Keeper) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were called in on your day off to feed the animals at the zoo because "
"none of your coworkers showed up for work for one reason or another."
msgstr ""
"그날은 휴일이었지만, 당신의 동료들 중 아무도 무슨 이유로든간에 출근하지 않아서, 당신이라도 출근해 동물들에게 먹이를 주라고 "
"호출받았습니다."

#. ~ Profession (female Zoo Keeper) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were called in on your day off to feed the animals at the zoo because "
"none of your coworkers showed up for work for one reason or another."
msgstr ""
"그날은 휴일이었지만, 당신의 동료들 중 아무도 무슨 이유로든간에 출근하지 않아서, 당신이라도 출근해 동물들에게 먹이를 주라고 "
"호출받았습니다."

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Golfer"
msgstr "골프 선수"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Golfer"
msgstr "골프 선수"

#. ~ Profession (male Golfer) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You decided to get away from the family for the day to do a little golfing "
"by yourself.  You were almost done playing the back nine when you called to "
"check on them and realized you couldn't get a signal."
msgstr ""
"당신은 그 날 혼자 골프를 치러 가족과 떨어졌습니다. 백 나인이 끝나갈 무렵 가족이 무사한지 확인하려 전화를 걸었지만, 신호가 잡히지 "
"않더군요."

#. ~ Profession (female Golfer) description
#: data/json/professions.json
