#. ~ Name for scenario 'Challenge - Mi-Go Camp' for a male character
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scenario_male"
msgid "Challenge - Mi-Go Camp"
msgstr "도전 - 미고 캠프"

#. ~ Name for scenario 'Challenge - Mi-Go Camp' for a female character
#: data/json/scenarios.json
