msgstr "길 한 가운데"

#. ~ Name for scenario 'Wilderness' for a male character
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scenario_male"
msgid "Wilderness"
msgstr "야생에서"

#. ~ Name for scenario 'Wilderness' for a female character
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scenario_female"
msgid "Wilderness"
msgstr "야생에서"

#. ~ Description for scenario 'Wilderness' for a male character.
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You find yourself amongst trees.  The screaming and the moaning is fainter "
"this far from civilization, but you'd better know what you're doing out "
"here."
msgstr ""
"정신을 차려보니 숲속이었습니다. 문명세계에서 멀어지니 비명과 울부짖음이 희미해졌지만, 우선 여기서 뭘 어떻게 해야 할지부터 "
"생각해봐야겠습니다."

