#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "central air filter"
msgstr "중앙 공기 필터"

#. ~ Description for central air filter
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "Cleans out dust mites, smoke particles, and more!"
msgstr "집먼지 진드기, 연기 입자같은 것을 걸러냅니다."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json data/json/obsoletion/vehicle_parts.json
msgid "dishwasher"
msgid_plural "dishwashers"
msgstr[0] "식기세척기"

#. ~ Description for dishwasher
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid ""
"This metal box used to spray hot water and soap at dirty dishes to make them"
" clean and to save people an unpleasant chore.  Now, with the power gone and"
" it sitting for a while, it's starting to smell a bit off."
msgstr ""
"이 금속 상자는 뜨거운 물과 세제를 더러운 접시에 뿌려, 접시들을 깨끗하게 만들고 사람들을 설거지에서 해방시켜줬습니다. 전기가 끊긴지 좀"
" 되어서 그런지, 썩은 냄새가 나기 시작합니다."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "dryer"
msgstr "건조기"

#. ~ Description for dryer
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "'Dry your clothes!' would be what you'd do if electricity was running."
msgstr "전기만 멀쩡하게 들어왔어도 광고 멘트대로 '옷이 뽀송뽀송'해졌을텐데요."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "abstract floor lamp"
msgstr "추상화 실내용 전등"

#. ~ Description for abstract floor lamp
#. ~ Description for abstract glass fridge
#. ~ Description for abstract fridge
#. ~ Description for abstract minifridge
#. ~ Description for abstract minifreezer
#. ~ Description for abstract air conditioner
#. ~ Description for abstract space heater
#. ~ Description for overhead light
#. ~ Description for abstract water purifier
#. ~ Description for abstract electric well pump
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-plumbing.json
msgid "Abstract furniture.  If you see this, something went wrong."
msgstr "추상적 가구입니다. 이걸 보고 있다는건 뭔가 잘못됐다는 뜻입니다."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "bonk!"
msgstr "펑!"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "floor lamp (off)"
msgstr "실내용 전등 (꺼짐)"

#. ~ Description for floor lamp (off)
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "A tall standing lamp, meant to plug into a wall and light up a room."
msgstr "키 큰 램프. 벽에 플러그를 꽂고 방을 밝히는 데에 사용합니다."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "Switch on the floor lamp."
msgstr "실내용 전등 켜기"

#. ~ Message for furniture 'floor lamp (off)'
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "You switch on the floor lamp."
msgstr "실내용 전등을 켰습니다."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "floor lamp (no power)"
msgstr "실내용 전등 (전력 없음)"

#. ~ Description for floor lamp (no power)
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "A tall standing lamp, plugged into a wall.  This one has no power."
msgstr "벽에 달린 콘센트에 연결된 길쭉한 실내용 전등입니다. 전기가 들어오지 않는 것 같습니다."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "Switch off the floor lamp."
msgstr "실내용 전등 끄기"

#. ~ Message for furniture 'floor lamp (no power)'
#. ~ Message for furniture 'floor lamp (on)'
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "You switch off the floor lamp."
msgstr "실내용 전등을 껐습니다."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "floor lamp (on)"
msgstr "실내용 전등 (켜짐)"

#. ~ Description for floor lamp (on)
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "A tall standing lamp, plugged into a wall."
msgstr "벽에 달린 콘센트에 연결된 길쭉한 실내용 전등입니다."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "grid floodlight (off)"
msgstr "망 연결된 투광 조명등 (꺼짐)"

#. ~ Description for grid floodlight (off)
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid ""
"An industrial flood light, hooked up to draw from a local grid.  Flicking it"
" on will output a nice, bright source of light."
msgstr "지역 전력망에 연결된 산업용 투광 조명등입니다. 전원을 켜면 멋진 광원이 되어줄 것입니다."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "Switch on the floodlight."
msgstr "투광 조명등 켜기"

#. ~ Message for furniture 'grid floodlight (off)'
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "You switch on the floodlight."
msgstr "투광 조명등을 켰습니다."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "grid floodlight (no power)"
msgstr "망 연결된 투광 조명등 (전력 없음)"

#. ~ Description for grid floodlight (no power)
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid ""
"An industrial flood light, hooked up to draw from a local grid.  It's "
"currently out of power."
msgstr "지역 전력망에 연결된 산업용 투광 조명등입니다. 현재 전력이 공급되지 않고 있습니다."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "Switch off the floodlight"
msgstr "투광 조명등 끄기"

#. ~ Message for furniture 'grid floodlight (no power)'
#. ~ Message for furniture 'grid floodlight (on)'
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "You switch off the floodlight."
msgstr "투광 조명등을 껐습니다."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "grid floodlight (on)"
msgstr "망 연결된 투광 조명등 (켜짐)"

#. ~ Description for grid floodlight (on)
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid ""
"An industrial flood light, hooked up to draw from a local grid.  It's "
"currently providing plenty of light."
msgstr "지역 전력망에 연결된 산업용 투광 조명등입니다. 현재 환한 빛을 발하고 있습니다."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "rewired street light (off)"
msgstr "개조된 가로등 (꺼짐)"

#. ~ Description for rewired street light (off)
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid ""
"A source of light used to illuminate streets and the surrounding area.  It's"
" been rewired to draw power from a local grid, but is currently switched "
"off."
msgstr "거리와 주변 영역을 밝히는데 쓰이던 가로등입니다. 구획 전력망에서 전력을 끌어오도록 개조되었지만, 현재 꺼져있습니다."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "Switch on the street light."
msgstr "가로등 켜기"

#. ~ Message for furniture 'rewired street light (off)'
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "You switch on the street light."
msgstr "가로등을 켭니다."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "rewired street light (no power)"
msgstr "개조된 가로등 (전력 없음)"

#. ~ Description for rewired street light (no power)
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid ""
"A source of light used to illuminate streets and the surrounding area.  It's"
" been rewired to draw power from a local grid, but lacks power at the "
"moment."
msgstr ""
"거리와 주변 영역을 밝히는데 쓰이던 가로등입니다. 구획 전력망에서 전력을 끌어오도록 개조되었지만, 현재 전력이 공급되지 않습니다."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "Switch off the street light."
msgstr "가로등 끄기"

#. ~ Message for furniture 'rewired street light (no power)'
#. ~ Message for furniture 'rewired street light (on)'
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "You switch off the street light."
msgstr "가로등을 끕니다."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "rewired street light (on)"
msgstr "개조된 가로등 (켜짐)"

#. ~ Description for rewired street light (on)
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid ""
"A source of light used to illuminate streets and the surrounding area.  It's"
" been rewired to draw power from a local grid, brightening up the night once"
" again."
msgstr ""
"거리와 주변 영역을 밝히는데 쓰이던 가로등입니다. 구획 전력망에서 전력을 끌어오도록 개조되어, 다시 한번 어둠을 몰아내는데 공헌하고 "
"있습니다."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "abstract glass fridge"
msgstr "추상화 유리문 냉장고"

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "glass door fridge (off)"
msgstr "유리문 냉장고 (전력 없음)"

#. ~ Description for glass door fridge (off)
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid ""
"There's something tantalizing about seeing the contents of a glass fridge on"
" display.  It is switched off."
msgstr "유리문 냉장고의 내용물이 훤히 들여다보이니 왠지 관심이 생깁니다. 현재 꺼져있습니다."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "Switch on the glass fridge."
msgstr "유리문 냉장고 켜기"

#. ~ Message for furniture 'glass door fridge (off)'
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "You switch on the glass fridge."
msgstr "유리문 냉장고를 켰습니다."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "glass door fridge"
msgstr "유리문 냉장고"

#. ~ Description for glass door fridge
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid ""
"There's something tantalizing about seeing the contents of a glass fridge on"
" display.  It has no power."
msgstr "유리문 냉장고의 내용물이 훤히 들여다보이니 왠지 관심이 생깁니다. 현재 전력이 공급되지 않습니다."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "Switch off the glass fridge."
msgstr "유리문 냉장고 끄기"

#. ~ Message for furniture 'glass door fridge'
#. ~ Message for furniture 'glass door fridge (on)'
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "You switch off the glass fridge."
msgstr "유리문 냉장고를 껐습니다."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "glass door fridge (on)"
msgstr "유리문 냉장고 (켜짐)"

#. ~ Description for glass door fridge (on)
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid ""
"There's something tantalizing about seeing the contents of a glass fridge on"
" display.  It is switched on."
msgstr "유리문 냉장고의 내용물이 훤히 들여다보이니 왠지 관심이 생깁니다. 현재 켜져있습니다."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "glass door freezer (off)"
msgstr "유리문 냉동고 (꺼짐)"

#. ~ Description for glass door freezer (off)
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid ""
"A glass door freezer!  Maybe there's some ice cream inside.  It is switched "
"off."
msgstr "유리문 냉동고입니다! 안에 아이스크림이 남아있을지도 모릅니다. 현재 꺼져있습니다."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "Switch on the glass freezer."
msgstr "유리문 냉동고 켜기"

#. ~ Message for furniture 'glass door freezer (off)'
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "You switch on the glass freezer."
msgstr "유리문 냉동고를 켰습니다."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "glass door freezer"
msgstr "유리문 냉동고"

#. ~ Description for glass door freezer
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid ""
"A glass door freezer!  Maybe there's some ice cream inside.  It has no "
"power."
msgstr "유리문 냉동고입니다! 안에 아이스크림이 남아있을지도 모릅니다. 현재 전력이 공급되지 않습니다."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "Switch off the glass freezer."
msgstr "유리문 냉동고 끄기"

#. ~ Message for furniture 'glass door freezer'
#. ~ Message for furniture 'glass freezer (on)'
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "You switch off the glass freezer."
msgstr "유리문 냉동고를 껐습니다."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "glass freezer (on)"
msgstr "유리문 냉동고 (켜짐)"

#. ~ Description for glass freezer (on)
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid ""
"A glass door freezer!  Maybe there's some ice cream inside.  It is switched "
"on."
msgstr "유리문 냉동고입니다! 안에 아이스크림이 남아있을지도 모릅니다. 현재 켜져있습니다."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "furnace"
msgstr "난방기"

#. ~ Description for furnace
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid ""
"A gas-powered forced-air central heating unit, with an internal fan to push "
"the air through a building's air ducts and keep it warm."
msgstr "가스로 돌아가는 강제 난방식 중앙 난방기로, 내부 팬으로 공기를 건물의 통풍관으로 보내 난방합니다."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
#: data/json/obsoletion/items.json data/json/obsoletion/vehicle_parts.json
msgid "washing machine"
msgid_plural "washing machines"
msgstr[0] "세탁기"

#. ~ Description for washing machine
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "You could wash your dirty clothes if electricity was running."
msgstr "옷을 세탁하는데 썼습니다. 전기가 들어오던 시절에요."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
#: data/json/items/fake.json data/json/items/furniture.json
msgid "oven"
msgid_plural "ovens"
msgstr[0] "오븐"

#. ~ Description for oven
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid ""
"Used for heating and cooking food with electricity.  Might still work, if "
"you manage to power it.  It's safe to light a fire inside of it."
msgstr ""
"전기로 작동하며, 음식을 데우고 조리하는데 쓰였습니다. 동력을 공급할 방법이 있다면 아직 작동할지도 모릅니다. 내부에 불을 피워도 "
"안전합니다."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
#: data/json/items/vehicle/rigs.json
msgid "RV kitchen unit"
msgid_plural "RV kitchen units"
msgstr[0] "RV 주방기구"

#. ~ Description for RV kitchen unit
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid ""
"Used for heating and cooking food with electricity.  Ripped from an RV.  "
"It's safe to light a fire inside of it."
msgstr "전기로 작동하며, 음식을 데우고 조리하는데 쓰입니다. RV에서 떼어냈습니다. 내부에 불을 피워도 안전합니다."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "blacksmith bellows"
msgstr "대장장이 풀무"

#. ~ Description for blacksmith bellows
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid ""
"Used for delivering air to increase the combustion and heat output of a "
"forge.  Doesn't look like it's working, although it still has parts."
msgstr ""
"대장일에 적합하게끔 연소와 열을 높이기 위해 공기를 불어넣는데 쓰였습니다. 지금은 작동하지 않는 것 같지만, 부품은 남아있습니다."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "blacksmith drop hammer"
msgstr "단조용 드롭 해머"

#. ~ Description for blacksmith drop hammer
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid ""
"Used for fast production of metal items.  Doesn't look like it's working, "
"although it still has parts."
msgstr "금속 물품을 빠르게 만드는데 쓰였습니다. 지금은 작동하지 않는 것 같지만, 부품은 남아있습니다."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "document shredder"
msgstr "세절기"

#. ~ Description for document shredder
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid ""
"It's not all about hiding government secrets, sometimes you just want to "
"stop identity theft."
msgstr "정부 기밀을 숨기는 용도뿐만 아니라, 누군가가 당신의 개인정보를 도용하는 것을 막는데도 쓰입니다."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
#: data/json/items/fake.json
msgid "server stack"
msgid_plural "server stacks"
msgstr[0] "서버"

#. ~ Description for server stack
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid ""
"This is a big pile of computers.  They're all turned off, but if you can get"
" power going it might be useful for training your Computers skill."
msgstr ""
"거대한 컴퓨터들의 더미입니다.  전부 꺼진 상태이지만, 어떻게든 전원을 켤 수 있다면 당신의 컴퓨터 기술에 유용할 것으로 보입니다."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "large satellite dish"
msgstr "커다란 위성 접시"

#. ~ Description for large satellite dish
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid ""
"Somewhere up there, there are still satellites, orbiting and doing their "
"thing, sending signals down to an Earth that is no longer listening."
msgstr "저 머리 위 어딘가에 지금도 위성들이 둥둥 뜬 채로, 지구에 들을 이 없는 신호를 보내고 있을 것입니다."

#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "mounted wind turbine"
msgstr "망 연결된 풍력발전용 터빈"

#. ~ Description for mounted wind turbine
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-appliances.json
msgid "A mounted wind turbine connected to building's electric grid."
msgstr "건물의 전력망에 연결된 풍력발전용 터빈입니다."

