"A mixed drink containing all the advantages of its ingredients and none of "
"their disadvantages.  It tastes great and it's a good source of nourishment."
msgstr "들어간 재료들의 모든 장점만 남기고 단점은 버린 혼합 음료. 맛있고 영양이 풍부합니다."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "honey ball"
msgid_plural "honey balls"
msgstr[0] "허니 볼"

#. ~ Description for honey ball
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"Droplet shaped ant food.  It's like a thick balloon the size of a baseball, "
"filled with sticky liquid.  Unlike bee honey, this has mostly a sour taste, "
"probably because ants feed upon a variety of things."
msgstr ""
"물방울 형태의 개미 먹이입니다. 야구공 정도 크기의 두툼한 풍선처럼 생겼으며, 내부에는 끈적거리는 액체가 가득 차있습니다. 이 액체는 "
"벌꿀과 달리 대체로 시큼한 맛이 납니다. 아마 개미가 온갖 것들을 먹이로 삼기 때문일 것입니다."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "spiked eggnog"
msgid_plural "spiked eggnogs"
msgstr[0] "술탄 에그노그"

#. ~ Description for spiked eggnog
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"Smooth and rich, this spoon-coating mixture of milk, cream, eggs, and booze "
"is a popular traditional holiday drink.  Having been fortified with alcohol,"
" it will keep for a long time."
msgstr ""
"부드럽고 맛이 깊은 술을 탄 에그노그는 우유, 크림, 계란과 술을 섞은 것. 크리스마스에 많이들 마시는 전통 음료입니다. 알코올이 "
"들어가서 오랫동안 보존할 수 있습니다."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "martini"
msgid_plural "martinis"
msgstr[0] "마티니"

#. ~ Description for martini
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid ""
"This is a popular cocktail made with gin and dry vermouth, dating from the "
"Prohibition era."
msgstr "역사가 금주령 시기로 거슬러올라가는 유명한 칵테일입니다. 진과 드라이 베르무트의 만남으로 이뤄져있습니다. "

#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "sake"
msgid_plural "sake"
msgstr[0] "사케"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'sake'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/alcohol.json
msgid "The traditional alcohol of Japan, this wine is made from rice."
msgstr "쌀로 빚어 만든 일본 전통주입니다."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "donut holes"
msgid_plural "donut holes"
msgstr[0] "도넛 홀"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'donut holes'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid ""
"These balls of dough have been cut into shape, covered with sugar, and "
"cooked to a crisp.  A staple of fairgrounds everywhere."
msgstr "도넛 가운데 구멍만한 크기의 동글동글한 튀김빵. 어느 축제에서든 쉽게 볼 수 있습니다."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "juvenile sourdough starter"
msgid_plural "juvenile sourdough starters"
msgstr[0] "미성숙 사워도우 발효종"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'juvenile sourdough starter'}.
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid ""
"After feeding it and caring for it for a week, your sourdough starter is "
"finally ready for the big leagues."
msgstr "일주일 동안 먹이를 주며 보살핀 결과, 당신의 사워도우 발효종은 좀 더 큰 물... 아니, 큰 반죽에서 놀 준비가 됐습니다."

#. ~ Use action not_ready_msg for {'str': 'juvenile sourdough starter'}.
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid ""
"You've been caring for your starter for a while, but it's going to need "
"longer before you can do anything tasty with it."
msgstr "발효종을 돌보기 시작한지는 좀 됐지만, 발효종으로 맛난걸 만드려면 조금 더 시간이 필요합니다."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'juvenile sourdough starter'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid ""
"A floury paste that is slowly going bad.  Someday it will be sourdough."
msgstr "서서히 발효 중인 밀가루 반죽입니다. 시간이 지나면 사워도우를 얻을 수 있습니다."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "freshly fed sourdough starter"
msgid_plural "freshly fed sourdough starters"
msgstr[0] "막 먹이를 준 사워도우 발효종"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'freshly fed sourdough starter'}.
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "The starter is now stinky and bubbly, and looks ready for cooking."
msgstr "발효종이 끈적이고 거품이 보글보글 솟아나는걸 볼 때, 이제 요리에 쓰면 적절하겠습니다."

#. ~ Use action not_ready_msg for {'str': 'freshly fed sourdough starter'}.
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "The starter isn't quite ready to go."
msgstr "이 발효종은 아직 준비되지 않았습니다."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'freshly fed sourdough starter'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid ""
"A floury paste with sourdough starter mixed in.  It needs a day to recover "
"its strength before it can be used again."
msgstr "사워도우 발효종을 넣은 밀가루 반죽입니다. 다시 써먹기 전에 하루 정도 기다려야 합니다."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "sourdough starter"
msgid_plural "sourdough starters"
msgstr[0] "사워도우 발효종"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'sourdough starter'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid ""
"A precious mix of flour, water, molds and bacteria from the air.  When you "
"add flour and water to it, after a few hours it froths and rises."
msgstr ""
"밀가루, 물, 곰팡이, 그리고 공기 중에서 온 박테리아의 귀중한 혼합물입니다. 밀가루와 물을 부어주면, 몇 시간 뒤 거품이 일어날 "
"것입니다."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "sourdough bread"
msgid_plural "sourdough breads"
msgstr[0] "사워도우 빵"

#. ~ Description for sourdough bread
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid ""
"Healthy and filling, with a sharper taste and thicker crust than yeast-only "
"bread."
msgstr "이스트로만 만든 빵보다 맛이 뚜렷하고, 빵껍질이 두툼합니다. 몸에 좋고 속도 든든합니다."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "flatbread"
msgid_plural "flatbreads"
msgstr[0] "플랫브레드"

#. ~ Description for flatbread
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "Simple unleavened bread."
msgstr "발효시키지 않은 간단한 빵."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "bread"
msgid_plural "breads"
msgstr[0] "빵"

#. ~ Description for bread
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "Healthy and filling."
msgstr "몸에 좋고 속도 든든합니다."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "garlic bread"
msgid_plural "garlic bread"
msgstr[0] "마늘빵"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'garlic bread'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "Bread cooked with garlic, oil and seasonings."
msgstr "마늘, 기름, 향신료를 발라 구운 빵입니다."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "cornbread"
msgid_plural "cornbreads"
msgstr[0] "옥수수빵"

#. ~ Description for cornbread
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "Healthy and filling cornbread."
msgstr "몸에 좋고 속도 든든한 옥수수빵입니다."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "johnnycake"
msgid_plural "johnnycakes"
msgstr[0] "조니 케이크"

#. ~ Description for johnnycake
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "A dense and tasty fried bread treat."
msgstr "속이 꽉 찬, 맛있는 옥수수빵 튀김입니다."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "blinkie"
msgid_plural "blinkies"
msgstr[0] "블링키"

#. ~ Description for blinkie
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid ""
"A sweet, cream-filled snack cake with an indefinitely long shelf life. For "
"all you know, this could be the last one that anyone will enjoy in the whole"
" universe."
msgstr ""
"달콤한 크림이 가득 들어간 스낵 케이크로, 유통기한이 사실상 무한하다. 어쩌면 이게 우주에서 누군가가 맛보게 될 마지막 한 개일지도 "
"모른다."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "fried blinkie"
msgid_plural "fried blinkies"
msgstr[0] "블링키 튀김"

#. ~ Description for fried blinkie
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid ""
"A sweet, cream-filled snack cake.  This one has been removed from the "
"packaging and deep fried, greatly reducing its shelf life."
msgstr "달콤한 크림이 든 스낵 케이크. 포장에서 꺼낸 뒤 기름에 깊이 튀겨서, 보관 수명이 크게 줄었다."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "corn tortilla"
msgid_plural "corn tortillas"
msgstr[0] "옥수수 토르티야"

#. ~ Description for corn tortilla
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "A round, thin flatbread made from finely ground corn flour."
msgstr "고운 옥수수 가루로 만든 둥글고 앏은 빵."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "hardtack"
msgid_plural "hardtacks"
msgstr[0] "건빵"

#. ~ Description for hardtack
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid ""
"A dry and virtually tasteless bread product capable of remaining edible "
"without spoilage for vast lengths of time."
msgstr "보관성을 위해 바짝 말린, 맛없는 빵입니다. 오랫동안 놔둬도 썩지 않습니다."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "biscuit"
msgid_plural "biscuits"
msgstr[0] "비스킷"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'biscuit'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "Wholesome and filling, this home made biscuit is pretty good!"
msgstr "몸에 좋고 배도 부릅니다. 수제 비스킷은 정말 좋아요!"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid "wastebread"
msgid_plural "wastebreads"
msgstr[0] "조악한 빵"

#. ~ Description for wastebread
#: data/json/items/comestibles/bread.json
msgid ""
"Flour is a commodity these days and to deal with that, most survivors resort"
" to mix it with leftovers of other ingredients and bake it all into bread.  "
"It's filling, and that's what matters."
msgstr ""
"요즘 밀가루는 구하기 힘든 물건이기에, 많은 생존자는 밀가루 약간을 그때그때 남아있는 다른 재료들과 함께 섞어 빵으로 굽습니다. 최소한 "
"배는 부르고, 그거면 됐죠."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "base brew"
msgid_plural "base brews"
msgstr[0] "기초 양조물"

#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "mycus wine must"
msgid_plural "mycus wine musts"
msgstr[0] "미발효 마이커스 와인"

#. ~ Description for mycus wine must
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid ""
"Unfermented mycus wine.  A goopy white mess, made from fruit of mycus.  It "
"smells sweetly of mushrooms."
msgstr "발효되지 않은 마이커스 와인입니다. 마이커스 과실로 만든 끈적하고 새하얀 덩어리입니다. 버섯의 달콤한 향기가 납니다."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "whiskey wort"
msgid_plural "whiskey worts"
msgstr[0] "미발효 위스키"

#. ~ Description for whiskey wort
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid ""
"Unfermented whiskey.  The base of a fine drink.  Not the traditional "
"preparation, but you don't have the time."
msgstr ""
"발효되지 않은 위스키입니다. 다른 음료를 만드는데 기주로 쓰기 좋습니다. 전통적인 방식으로 만들어진건 아니지만, 그러기엔 시간이 "
"부족하니까요."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "whiskey wash"
msgid_plural "whiskey washes"
msgstr[0] "위스키 발효액"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'whiskey wash', 'str_pl': 'whiskey washes'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "Fermented, but not distilled whiskey.  No longer tastes sweet."
msgstr "발효는 되었으나 아직 증류하지 않은 위스키입니다. 더이상 단맛이 나지 않습니다."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "fermenting gin mash"
msgid_plural "fermenting gin mashes"
msgstr[0] "발효 중인 진"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'fermenting gin mash', 'str_pl': 'fermenting gin
#. mashes'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "Undistilled gin mash.  Distilling it will produce gin."
msgstr "증류되지 않은 급조 진입니다. 증류하여 진을 얻어낼 수 있습니다."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "gin mash"
msgid_plural "gin mashes"
msgstr[0] "급조 진"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'gin mash', 'str_pl': 'gin mashes'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid ""
"Gin mash, after the junipers have had time to add flavor, ready to be "
"distilled or drunk as is."
msgstr "향을 더하기 위해 숙성시킨 두송실을 으깬 것입니다. 그대로 마시거나, 증류할 수 있습니다."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "vodka wort"
msgid_plural "vodka worts"
msgstr[0] "미발효 보드카"

#. ~ Description for vodka wort
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid ""
"Unfermented vodka.  Water with sugar from enzymatic breakdown of malted "
"grains or just added in pure form."
msgstr ""
"발효되지 않은 보드카입니다. 맥아의 효소 분해를 통해 만들어진 설탕과 물의 혼합물입니다. 아니면 그냥 설탕을 냅다 집어넣었든지요."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "vodka wash"
msgid_plural "vodka washes"
msgstr[0] "보드카 발효액"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'vodka wash', 'str_pl': 'vodka washes'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "Fermented, but not distilled vodka.  No longer tastes sweet."
msgstr "발효는 되었으나 아직 증류하지 않은 보드카입니다. 더이상 단맛이 나지 않습니다."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "rum wort"
msgid_plural "rum worts"
msgstr[0] "미발효 럼"

#. ~ Description for rum wort
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid ""
"Unfermented rum.  Sugar caramel or molasses brewed into sweet water.  "
"Basically a saccharine soup."
msgstr "발효되지 않은 럼주. 설탕 캐러멜이나 당밀로 양조해서 만든 단물입니다. 근본적으로, 지나치게 단 수프라고 볼 수 있습니다."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "rum wash"
msgid_plural "rum washes"
msgstr[0] "럼 발효액"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'rum wash', 'str_pl': 'rum washes'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "Fermented, but not distilled rum.  No longer tastes sweet."
msgstr "발효는 되었으나 아직 증류하지 않은 럼입니다. 더이상 단맛이 나지 않습니다."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "fruit wine must"
msgid_plural "fruit wine musts"
msgstr[0] "미발효 과실주"

#. ~ Description for fruit wine must
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid ""
"Unfermented fruit wine.  A sweet, boiled juice made from berries or fruit."
msgstr "발효되지 않은 과실주입니다. 열매나 과일로 만든 주스를 끓인 것이며, 향기롭습니다."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "dandelion wine must"
msgid_plural "dandelion wine musts"
msgstr[0] "미발효 민들레 술"

#. ~ Description for dandelion wine must
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid ""
"Unfermented dandelion wine.  A sticky mixture of water, sugar, yeast, and "
"dandelion petals."
msgstr "발효되지 않은 민들레술입니다. 물, 설탕, 효모, 민들레 꽃잎의 끈적한 혼합물입니다."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "burdock wine must"
msgid_plural "burdock wine musts"
msgstr[0] "미발효 우엉 와인"

#. ~ Description for burdock wine must
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid ""
"Unfermented burdock wine.  A sticky mixture of water, sugar, yeast, and "
"burdock roots."
msgstr "발효되지 않은 우엉 와인입니다. 물, 설탕, 효모, 우엉 뿌리의 끈적한 혼합물입니다."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "pine wine must"
msgid_plural "pine wine musts"
msgstr[0] "미발효 소나무 술"

#. ~ Description for pine wine must
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid ""
"Unfermented pine wine.  A sticky mixture of water, sugar, yeast, and pine "
"resins."
msgstr "발효되지 않은 소나무 술입니다. 물, 설탕, 효모, 송진의 끈적한 혼합물입니다."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "spiced mead must"
msgid_plural "spiced mead musts"
msgstr[0] "미발효 벌꿀주"

#. ~ Description for spiced mead must
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "Unfermented spiced mead.  Diluted honey and yeast."
msgstr "꿀과 이스트를 희석한 벌꿀주. 아직 완전히 발효되지 않았습니다."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "beer wort"
msgid_plural "beer worts"
msgstr[0] "미발효 맥주"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'beer wort'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid ""
"Unfermented homebrew beer.  A boiled and chilled mash of malted barley, "
"spiced with some fine hops."
msgstr "발효되지 않은 수제 맥주입니다. 보리맥아 혼합물을 끓인 후, 좋은 홉을 넣고, 차갑게 식혔습니다."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "moonshine mash"
msgid_plural "moonshine mashes"
msgstr[0] "미발효 밀조주"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'moonshine mash', 'str_pl': 'moonshine mashes'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid ""
"Unfermented moonshine.  Just some water, sugar and corn, like good ol' "
"aunt's recipe."
msgstr "발효되지 않은 밀주입니다. 우리 아주머니가 만드시던 그대로 물, 설탕, 옥수수만으로 만들었습니다."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid "moonshine wash"
msgid_plural "moonshine washes"
msgstr[0] "밀조주 발효액"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'moonshine wash', 'str_pl': 'moonshine washes'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/brewing.json
msgid ""
"Fermented, but not distilled moonshine.  Contains all the contaminants you "
"don't want in your moonshine."
