#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'canned fruit'}
#: data/json/items/comestibles/fruit_dishes.json
msgid ""
"This sodden mass of preserved fruit was boiled and canned in an earlier "
"life.  Bland, mushy and losing color, likely due to the lack of added sugar."
msgstr ""
"세상이 멸망하기 전에 과일을 삶아 만든 보존식품입니다. 설탕을 충분히 넣지 않았는지 밋밋하고, 흐물흐물하며, 본래의 색을 잃었습니다."

