#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"A pickled cucumber.  Rather sour, but tastes good and lasts for a long time."
msgstr "절인 오이. 시큼하지만, 꽤 맛있고 오랫동안 상하지 않는다."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "sauerkraut w/ sautee'd onions"
