"A Korean vegetable fritter made by coating ingredients in a light egg batter"
" and pan-frying them into a thin, savory pancake."
msgstr "속재료를 계란 반죽과 함께 구워 얇고 맛있는 부침개로 구워낸 한국식 채소 요리입니다."

#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
