#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "fencing saber"
msgid_plural "fencing sabers"
msgstr[0] "펜싱용 사브르"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'fencing saber'}
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A weapon used for fencing, the most noble of all sports.  The fencing saber "
"is marginally shorter than the foil and épée, but no less effective."
msgstr ""
"모든 스포츠 중에서 가장 귀족적인 스포츠인 펜싱에 사용되는 무기. 펜싱용 사브르는 플뢰레와 에페보다 약간 짧지만 더 효과적입니다."

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "sharpened saber"
msgid_plural "sharpened sabers"
msgstr[0] "날을 세운 사브르"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'sharpened saber'}
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"This once mostly harmless fencing saber has had its rounded tip snapped off "
"and has been crudely sharpened to a point.  Though it still lacks a cutting "
"edge, it is now considerably more lethal, yet still familiar to the "
"practiced fencer."
msgstr ""
"한때 무해한 펜싱용 도검이었지만, 둥근 끝을 부러뜨려 예리하게 갈았습니다. 절단용 날이 없긴 하지만, 기존보다 더 치명적인 무기가 "
"되었습니다. 그렇지만 숙련된 펜싱선수에게나 친숙할 무기이긴 합니다."

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "electrified saber (off)"
msgid_plural "electrified sabers (off)"
msgstr[0] "전격 사브르 (꺼짐)"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'electrified saber (off)', 'str_pl':
#. 'electrified sabers (off)'}.
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "You press a button and the sabre crackles with electricity."
msgstr "버튼을 누르자 사브르에서 스파크가 튀기 시작합니다."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'electrified saber (off)', 'str_pl': 'electrified
#. sabers (off)'}
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"The modifications made to this fencing saber may not be sporting, but they "
"might give you an edge in this final competition.  Extra effort has been "
"made to insulate the grip and a high voltage stun gun has been attached to "
"the guard, wired to the tip along the saber's groove.  Activate the switch "
"to electrocute your foes!"
msgstr ""
"이 개조된 펜싱용 사브르는 스포츠 정신에 어긋나지만, 생사가 갈리는 마지막 승부에 유용할 것 같습니다. 손잡이를 절연처리하고 홈 부분에 "
"고전압 스턴건을 장착해, 칼끝의 점수 판정 회로에 연결했습니다. 작동시키면 벤 적을 감전시킬 수 있습니다!"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "electrified saber (on)"
msgid_plural "electrified sabers (on)"
msgstr[0] "전격 사브르 (켜짐)"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'electrified saber (on)', 'str_pl': 'electrified
#. sabers (on)'}
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"The modifications made to this fencing saber may not be sporting, but they "
"might give you an edge in this final competition.  Extra effort has been "
"made to insulate the grip and a high voltage stun gun has been attached to "
"the guard, wired through the electronic scoring circuit to the tip.  It is "
"currently turned on."
msgstr ""
"이 개조된 펜싱용 사브르는 스포츠 정신에 어긋나지만, 생사가 갈리는 마지막 승부에 유용할 것 같습니다. 손잡이를 절연처리하고 홈 부분에 "
"고전압 스턴건을 장착해, 칼끝의 점수 판정 회로에 연결했습니다. 현재 켜져있습니다."

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "sword cane"
msgid_plural "sword canes"
msgstr[0] "지팡이 검"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'sword cane'}
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "A sword with a thin blade designed to be hidden inside a hollow cane."
msgstr "지팡이 속을 비우고 얇은 검날을 숨긴 것입니다."

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "broadsword"
msgid_plural "broadswords"
msgstr[0] "브로드소드"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'broadsword'}
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"This is an early modern sword seeing use in the 16th, 17th, and 18th "
"centuries.  Called 'broad' to contrast with the slimmer rapiers."
msgstr ""
"근대 직전 즉 16, 17, 18세기까지 사용되었던 검. '넓다(Broad)'는 말은 얇은 레이피어에 비해서 넓다는 의미입니다."

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "broadsword replica"
msgid_plural "broadsword replicas"
msgstr[0] "브로드소드 레플리카"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'broadsword replica'}
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"This is an early modern sword seeing use in the 16th, 17th, and 18th "
"centuries.  This sword appears to be made very poorly, but it should still "
"stand up to a few swings."
msgstr ""
"근대 직전 즉 16, 17, 18세기까지 사용되었던 검. 이 검은 매우 조잡하게 만들어진 것 같지만, 몇 번 베는 것 정돈 버틸 수 있을"
" 것 같습니다."

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "broadsword fake"
msgid_plural "broadsword fakes"
msgstr[0] "가짜 브로드소드"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'broadsword fake'}
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"This is a dull, cheaply made replica of an early modern sword seeing use in "
"the 16th, 17th, and 18th centuries.  Called 'broad' to contrast with the "
"slimmer rapiers."
msgstr ""
"근대 직전 즉 16, 17, 18세기까지 사용되었던 검. 날이 무디고 조잡하게 복제된 복제품입니다. '넓다(Broad)'는 말은 얇은 "
"레이피어에 비해서 넓다는 의미입니다."

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "rapier"
msgid_plural "rapiers"
msgstr[0] "레이피어"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'rapier'}
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"This is a thin sword with an ornate hand guard.  It looks like the preferred"
" weapon of gentlemen and swashbucklers.  Light and quick, it makes any "
"battle a stylish battle."
msgstr ""
"화려하게 장식된 핸드가드가 달린 얇은 검입니다. 신사와 검술가들이 선호하는 무기입니다. 가볍고 빠르며, 우아한 전투가 가능합니다."

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "electrified rapier (off)"
msgid_plural "electrified rapiers (off)"
msgstr[0] "전격 레이피어 (꺼짐)"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'electrified rapier (off)', 'str_pl':
#. 'electrified rapiers (off)'}.
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "You press a button and the rapier crackles with electricity."
msgstr "버튼을 누르자 레이피어에서 스파크가 튀기 시작합니다."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'electrified rapier (off)', 'str_pl':
#. 'electrified rapiers (off)'}
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"The modifications made to this rapier may not be sporting, but they might "
"give you an edge in this final competition.  Extra effort has been made to "
"insulate the grip and a high voltage stun gun has been attached to the "
"guard, wired to the tip along the saber's groove.  Activate the switch to "
"electrocute your foes!"
msgstr ""
"이 개조된 펜싱용 레이피어는 스포츠 정신에 어긋나지만, 생사가 갈리는 마지막 승부에 유용할 것 같습니다. 손잡이를 절연처리하고 홈 부분에"
" 고전압 스턴건을 장착해, 칼끝의 점수 판정 회로에 연결했습니다. 작동시키면 공격한 적을 감전시킬 수 있습니다!"

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "electrified rapier (on)"
msgid_plural "electrified rapiers (on)"
msgstr[0] "전격 레이피어 (켜짐)"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'electrified rapier (on)', 'str_pl':
#. 'electrified rapiers (on)'}.
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "You press a button and the rapier turns off."
msgstr "버튼을 누르자 레이피어의 전원이 꺼집니다."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'electrified rapier (on)', 'str_pl': 'electrified
#. rapiers (on)'}
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"The modifications made to this rapier may not be sporting, but they might "
"give you an edge in this final competition.  Extra effort has been made to "
"insulate the grip and a high voltage stun gun has been attached to the "
"guard, wired through the electronic scoring circuit to the tip.  It is "
"currently turned on."
msgstr ""
"이 개조된 펜싱용 레이피어는 스포츠 정신에 어긋나지만, 생사가 갈리는 마지막 승부에 유용할 것 같습니다. 손잡이를 절연처리하고 홈 부분에"
" 고전압 스턴건을 장착해, 칼끝의 점수 판정 회로에 연결했습니다. 현재 켜져있습니다."

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "rapier fake"
msgid_plural "rapier fakes"
msgstr[0] "가짜 레이피어"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'rapier fake'}
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"This is a blunted, cheap replica of a thin sword with an ornate hand guard."
"  It looks like the preferred weapon of gentlemen and swashbucklers.  Light "
"and quick, it makes any battle a stylish battle."
msgstr ""
"화려하게 장식된 핸드가드가 달린 얇은 검의 무디고 저렴한 모형. 허세부리길 좋아하는 사람이나 신사가 선호하는 무기이다. 가볍고 빠른 "
"무기로, 어떤 전투라도 우아하게 바꿔줄 것이다."

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "katana"
msgid_plural "katanas"
msgstr[0] "일본도"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'katana'}
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"This is a rare sword from Japan.  Deadly against unarmored targets, and "
"still very effective against armor."
msgstr "일본에서 전래된 희귀한 칼. 무장하지 않은 적에게 치명적이며, 무장한 상태라도 충분히 위협적이다."

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "katana replica"
msgid_plural "katana replicas"
msgstr[0] "일본도 레플리카"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'katana replica'}
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"This is a rare sword from Japan.  While it's got the right edge and balance,"
" the pommel just snaps off, and the blade seems pretty worn."
msgstr ""
"일본에서 만들어진 희귀한 검입니다. 칼날이 제대로 서있고 무게균형도 맞지만, 폼멜이 툭툭 꺾이고 도신도 꽤 낡아있는 것 같습니다."

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "katana fake"
msgid_plural "katana fakes"
msgstr[0] "가짜 일본도"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'katana fake'}
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "This is a dull, cheaply made replica of a rare sword from Japan."
msgstr "일본에서 전래된 희귀한 칼을 본떠 만든 무디고 저렴한 모형."

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "pair of butterfly swords"
msgid_plural "pairs of butterfly swords"
msgstr[0] "나비 쌍수도"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'pair of butterfly swords', 'str_pl': 'pairs of
#. butterfly swords'}
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"This is a matched pair of traditional Shaolin butterfly swords.  They are "
"about the size of machetes but have hand guards and wider blades."
msgstr "전통적인 소림 나비 칼 한 쌍입니다. 마체테와 크기가 비슷하지만 손 보호대가 있으며 더 넓은 칼날을 가지고 있습니다."

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "chainsaw lajatang (off)"
msgid_plural "chainsaw lajatangs (off)"
msgstr[0] "엔진톱 월아산 (꺼짐)"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'chainsaw lajatang (off)', 'str_pl': 'chainsaw
#. lajatangs (off)'}.
#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'electric chainsaw lajatang (off)', 'str_pl':
#. 'electric chainsaw lajatangs (off)'}.
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "You turn on the chainsaw lajatang."
msgstr "엔진톱 월아산의 전원을 켰습니다."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'chainsaw lajatang (off)', 'str_pl': 'chainsaw
#. lajatangs (off)'}
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A long wooden pole with chainsaws impractically attached to both ends.  The "
"product of either genius or insanity, but not both; the weight ensures that "
"only someone both strong and very skilled could possibly hope to use it."
msgstr ""
"터무니없지만, 긴 나무 막대 양쪽 끝에 전기톱을 부착한 무기. 이걸 만든 사람은 천재거나 정신 이상자 둘 중 하나인것 같습니다. 무거운 "
"무게로 인해 사용자의 힘과 숙련도가 상당해야만 사용할 수 있습니다."

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "chainsaw lajatang (on)"
msgid_plural "chainsaw lajatangs (on)"
msgstr[0] "엔진톱 월아산 (켜짐)"

#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'chainsaw lajatang (on)', 'str_pl': 'chainsaw
#. lajatangs (on)'}.
#. ~ Use action msg for {'str': 'electric chainsaw lajatang (on)', 'str_pl':
#. 'electric chainsaw lajatangs (on)'}.
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "You turn off the chainsaw lajatang."
msgstr "엔진톱 월아산의 전원을 껐습니다."

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'chainsaw lajatang (on)', 'str_pl': 'chainsaw
#. lajatangs (on)'}
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A long wooden pole with chainsaws impractically attached to both ends.  They"
" are currently on and draining gasoline; use this item to turn them off."
msgstr ""
"터무니없지만, 긴 나무 막대 양쪽 끝에 전기톱을 부착한 무기. 현재 작동 중이며 휘발유를 소모하고 있습니다. 사용하면 작동을 중지합니다."

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "electric chainsaw lajatang (off)"
msgid_plural "electric chainsaw lajatangs (off)"
msgstr[0] "전기톱 월아산 (꺼짐)"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'electric chainsaw lajatang (off)', 'str_pl':
#. 'electric chainsaw lajatangs (off)'}
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A long wooden pole with electric chainsaws impractically attached to both "
"ends.  The product of either genius or insanity, but not both; the weight "
"ensures that only someone both strong and very skilled could possibly hope "
"to use it."
msgstr ""
"터무니없지만, 긴 나무 막대 양쪽 끝에 전기톱이 장착되어있다. 이걸 만든 사람은 천재거나 정신 이상자로 유추되지만, 양쪽 모두는 아닌 것"
" 같다. 무거운 무게로 인해 사용자의 힘과 숙련도가 상당해야만 사용할 수 있도록 만들어져있다."

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "electric chainsaw lajatang (on)"
msgid_plural "electric chainsaw lajatangs (on)"
msgstr[0] "전기톱 월아산 (켜짐)"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'electric chainsaw lajatang (on)', 'str_pl':
#. 'electric chainsaw lajatangs (on)'}
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A long wooden pole with electric chainsaws impractically attached to both "
"ends.  They are currently on and draining power; use this item to turn them "
"off."
msgstr ""
"터무니없지만, 긴 나무 막대 양쪽 끝에 전기톱을 부착한 무기. 현재 작동 중이며 전력을 소모하고 있습니다. 사용하면 작동을 중지합니다."

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "cutlass"
msgid_plural "cutlasses"
msgstr[0] "커틀러스"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'cutlass', 'str_pl': 'cutlasses'}
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"This is a broad saber known for its use by sailors and pirates, as its short"
" blade is easy to handle in close quarters."
msgstr "선원이나 해적들이 사용하던 날이 넓은 세이버입니다. 검신이 그리 길지 않아서 근접 전투에서 다루기 쉽습니다."

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "cutlass replica"
msgid_plural "cutlass replicas"
msgstr[0] "커틀러스 레플리카"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'cutlass replica'}
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"This is a broad saber known for its use by sailors and pirates.  This sword "
"appears to be made very poorly, but it should still stand up to a few "
"swings."
msgstr ""
"선원이나 해적들이 사용하던 날이 넓은 세이버입니다. 이 검은 매우 조잡하게 만들어진 것 같지만, 몇 번 베는 것 정돈 버틸 수 있을 것 "
"같습니다."

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "cutlass fake"
msgid_plural "cutlass fakes"
msgstr[0] "가짜 커틀러스"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'cutlass fake'}
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"This is a dull, cheaply made replica of a broad saber known for its use by "
"sailors and pirates."
msgstr "선원과 해적이 사용하던 것으로 알려진 넓은 세이버 형태를 지닌 검의 무디고 저렴한 모형입니다."

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "makeshift macuahuitl"
msgid_plural "makeshift macuahuitls"
msgstr[0] "간이 마쿠아휘틀"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'makeshift macuahuitl'}
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A flat wooden club with sharpened pieces of stone sticking to both of its "
"sides."
msgstr "양면에 돌 조각이 박힌 납작한 나무 곤봉이다."

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "razorblade macuahuitl"
msgid_plural "razorblade macuahuitls"
msgstr[0] "면도날 마쿠아휘틀"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'razorblade macuahuitl'}
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A flat wooden club with razor blades set into the edges.  Significantly "
"sharper than using stone blades."
msgstr "모서리에 면도날을 박아넣은 평평한 나무 몽둥이입니다. 돌 칼날에 비해 훨씬 날카롭습니다."

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "lajatang"
msgid_plural "lajatangs"
msgstr[0] "월아산"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'lajatang'}
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"An exotic weapon comprised of a long pole of wood with curved blades on each"
" end.  It can be deadly in skilled hands."
msgstr "긴 나무 막대 끝에 곡선형 칼날이 달린 중국의 무기. 숙련된 사람이 쓰면 치명적입니다."

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid "combat chainsaw (off)"
msgid_plural "combat chainsaws (off)"
msgstr[0] "전투용 엔진톱 (꺼짐)"

