#. ~ Description for {'str': 'carbon fiber nodachi'}
#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
msgid ""
"A custom 3D-printed single-bladed two-handed sword made out of carbon fiber."
"  It is more lightweight than a normal sword thanks to its method of "
"manufacturing, but it can only be repaired using a 3D printer."
msgstr ""
"3D 프린터를 이용해 만든 탄소섬유 외날양손검입니다. 제조 방식 덕분에 일반적인 검에 비해 훨씬 가볍지만, 3D 프린터로만 수리할 수 "
"있습니다."

#: data/json/items/melee/swords_and_blades.json
