#. ~ Description for {'str': 'advanced butchering station'}
#: data/json/items/vehicle/tables.json data/json/vehicleparts/utilities.json
msgid ""
"Combining a fixed-up dissector, workbench and advanced electronics, this is "
"a marvel capable of butchering, dissecting and cutting like nothing else!"
msgstr "고정식 해부 기구, 작업대, 첨단 전자제품이 결합되어 기존에는 불가능했던 도축, 해부, 절단의 혁명이 일어났습니다!"

#: data/json/items/vehicle/turrets.json
#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
