msgstr[0] "터렛 자동 재장전기"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'turret autoloader'}
#: data/json/items/vehicle/turrets.json
msgid ""
"An automated ammunition feeding system designed for vehicle-mounted turrets."
" Requires electric power to operate."
msgstr "차량용 터렛에 맞게 설계된 자동 재장전기입니다. 작동하려면 전력이 필요합니다."

#: data/json/items/vehicle/utilities.json
#: data/json/vehicleparts/vehicle_parts.json
msgid "military black box"
msgid_plural "military black boxes"
msgstr[0] "군용 블랙박스"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'military black box', 'str_pl': 'military black
#. boxes'}
#: data/json/items/vehicle/utilities.json
msgid ""
"This is a black box, seemingly pulled from some sort of military vehicle "
"wreckage.  If you can find a system to analyze this, you may find something "
