msgid "A small portable plutonium reactor.  Handle with great care!"
msgstr "휴대 가능한 소형 플루토늄 반응로. 조심해서 다루세요!"

#: data/json/items/vehicle/utilities.json
msgid "vehicle cooler"
msgid_plural "vehicle coolers"
msgstr[0] "차량용 에어컨"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'vehicle cooler'}
#: data/json/items/vehicle/utilities.json
