msgstr "방랑하는 생존자"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "I hate thorazine!"
msgstr "난 토라진이 싫어!"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Arg thorazine, don't touch it!"
msgstr "으으 토라진, 만지지 마!"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Thorazine is bad for you, you know."
msgstr "토라진은 네 몸에 안 좋은 거잖아."

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Thorazine is poison."
msgstr "토라진은 독이야."

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Thorazine?  I wouldn't if I were you."
msgstr "토라진? 나 같으면 안 먹었다."

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "You don't need thorazine, it's limiting you."
msgstr "넌 토라진 같은 거 필요 없잖아. 네 발목을 잡을 뿐이야."

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Thorazine…  That's what 'they' use to keep you tame."
msgstr "토라진... '그 녀석들'이 널 길들이기 위해 썼던 거지."

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid ""
"Don't.  This thorazine seriously clouds your mind.  You need to stay sharp."
msgstr "먹지 마라. 토라진은 네 마음을 흐리게 만든다. 정신 차려!"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Pink tablets!  I love those!"
msgstr "분홍 알약! 너무 좋아!"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Hey there's some pink tablets, take some!"
msgstr "야 여기 분홍 알약이다. 좀 드셔봐!"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Look, some LSD, let's play Cataclysm: fun times ahead!"
msgstr "봐, LSD야! 카타클리즘: 펀 타임즈 어헤드 하자구!"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Say yes to LSD, say yes to Fun!"
msgstr "안녕 LSD, 안녕 재미야!"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Perfect, those pink tablets will keep us going, take some!"
msgstr "완벽해. 그 분홍 알약이 있으면 우린 계속 갈 수 있을거야. 좀 하자고!"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "You know what would make all this more bearable?  Pink Tablets!"
msgstr "이 모든걸 더 견딜만하게 만드는게 뭐게? 분홍 알약!"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "An odd pink tablet from the ground?  I don't see why not!"
msgstr "바닥에서 주운 기묘한 분홍 알약? 들이키지 않을 이유가 없군!"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Finally, something to take the edge off."
msgstr "드디어 이 지긋지긋한 세상을 잊어버리는데 유용할게 생겼군."

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json src/npctalk.cpp
msgid "No thanks, I'm good."
msgstr "아니, 난 괜찮아."

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "I don't want to trade with you."
msgstr "너랑 거래하기 싫은데."

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "I have the best stuff.  And I'm keeping it!"
msgstr "난 항상 최고급 물건만 가지고 다니지. 남한테 주지 않고 내 주머니에만 말이야!"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "No trading, that's my rule."
msgstr "거래는 없어. 그게 내 규칙이야."

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "I'm not interested."
msgstr "관심 없어."

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "How about no?"
msgstr "안된다고 하면 어떻게 할건데?"

