msgid ""
"Oh definitely, how about one of those beers I see on you?  What's up anyway?"
msgstr "오, 물론이지, 맥주 한 잔은 어때? 근데 무슨 일이야?"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid ""
"Yeah you share those beers I see you hoarding and then we chat all you like!"
"  Only joking, what's up <name_g>?"
msgstr "그래 그 맥주 좀 주고 나서 이야기하자고! 농담이야, 무슨 일인데 <name_g>?"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
