msgstr "대화 주제를 좀 바꿀까."

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "I'd like to ask you about something else."
msgstr "다른걸 물어보고 싶어."

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Moving on…"
msgstr "그래서…"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Anyway…"
msgstr "어쨌든…"

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Something else before we head out…"
msgstr "우리가 출발하기 전에 뭔가..."

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "So, where was I…"
msgstr "그래서, 무슨 이야기까지 했지..."

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "We should probably get going."
msgstr "움직여야 할 것 같은데."

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "We'd better get moving."
msgstr "움직이는게 낫겠어."

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Let's head out."
msgstr "얼른 가자고."

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Time's a-wasting.  Let's head out."
msgstr "시간이 없어. 가자고."

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Come on.  We got stuff to do."
msgstr "빨리 가자. 할 일이 산더미야."

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Let's hit the road."
msgstr "도로를 좀 달릴 시간인데."

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "We'll pick this up another time.  Let's go."
msgstr "그건 나중에 해도 돼. 얼른 가자."

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Let's put a pin in this chat for now."
msgstr "이 이야기는 일단 여기까지만 해두자고."

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Talk to you later."
msgstr "나중에 이야기하자."

#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "We should get a move on."
msgstr "움직여야 해."

