msgstr "%1$s(이)가 <npcname>에게 주사기로 찔러 넣었다!"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/monster_attacks.json
msgid "The %1$s tries to inject you, but fails to penetrate your armor!"
msgstr "%1$s(이)가 주사기를 찔렀으나, 방어구를 뚫지 못했습니다!"

#: data/mods/Aftershock/monster_attacks.json
msgid ""
"The %1$s tries to inject <npcname>, but fails to penetrate their armor!"
msgstr "%1$s(이)가 <npcname>에게 주사기를 찔렀으나, 갑옷을 뚫지 못했습니다!"

