msgid ""
"While initially a mere Combat Medic, you have demonstrated exceptional "
"medical ability. While you never recieved a C.R.I.T. Medical Blimp, you "
"still were given the best gear CRIT has to offer."
msgstr ""
"당신은 본래 전투 의무병이었지만, 탁월한 의무 능력을 발휘한 덕분에 승진되었습니다. C.R.I.T. 의료선을 받지는 못했지만, 그래도 "
