msgid "Operator CBRN"
msgstr "화생방병"

#. ~ Profession (male Operator CBRN) description
#: data/mods/Fuji_Mil_Prof/prof/spc.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Chemical weapons?  Check.  Biological outbreak?  Check.  Nuclear war?  "
"Check.  Sounds like the perfect job for you!"
msgstr "화학무기? 확인. 생물학적 재난? 확인. 핵전쟁? 확인. 당신에게 완벽한 직업 같군요!"

#. ~ Profession (female Operator CBRN) description
#: data/mods/Fuji_Mil_Prof/prof/spc.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Chemical weapons?  Check.  Biological outbreak?  Check.  Nuclear war?  "
"Check.  Sounds like the perfect job for you!"
msgstr "화학무기? 확인. 생물학적 재난? 확인. 핵전쟁? 확인. 당신에게 완벽한 직업 같군요!"

#: data/mods/JP_Weather_Variants/modinfo.json
msgid "Weather Variants"
msgstr "날씨 변형"

#. ~ Description for Weather Variants
#: data/mods/JP_Weather_Variants/modinfo.json
msgid ""
"Additional weathers ported from the Japanese CDDA variant and modified to fit BN.\n"
"\n"
"Enables acid rain and adds the following weather: Rainbows, Sundogs (renamed from Diamond Dust), Northern Lights, Geomagnetic Storms, Acid Flurries, Acid Snow, and Acid Snowstorms."
msgstr ""
"일본 CDDA 판본에서 포팅되어 밝은밤에 맞게 조정된 날씨들입니다.\n"
"\n"
"산성비를 허용하며, 이하 날씨를 추가합니다: 무지개, 환일 (다이아몬드 더스트에서 변경됨), 북극광, 지자기 폭풍, 산성 진눈깨비, 산성눈, 강산 눈폭풍"

#: data/mods/JP_Weather_Variants/morale_types.json
