#: data/mods/No_Fungi/modinfo.json
msgid "No Fungal Monsters"
msgstr "진균 괴물 제거"

#. ~ Description for No Fungal Monsters
#: data/mods/No_Fungi/modinfo.json
msgid "Removes fungal monsters and regions from the game."
