#: data/mods/exotic_ammo/magazine/46.json
msgid "H&K 4.6mm magazine"
msgid_plural "H&K 4.6mm magazines"
msgstr[0] "H&K 4.6mm 탄창"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'H&K 4.6mm magazine'}
#: data/mods/exotic_ammo/magazine/46.json
msgid ""
"A standard capacity 20-round magazine for use with H&K's proprietary "
"4.6x30mm round."
msgstr "H&K 사의 독자 개발 4.6x30mm 탄약을 사용하는 20발 들이 탄창."

#: data/mods/exotic_ammo/magazine/500.json
msgid ".500 5-round speedloader"
msgid_plural ".500 5-round speedloaders"
msgstr[0] ".500 5발 스피드로더"

#. ~ Description for {'str': '.500 5-round speedloader'}
#: data/mods/exotic_ammo/magazine/500.json
msgid ""
"This speedloader can hold 5 rounds of .500 and quickly reload a compatible "
"revolver."
msgstr ".500 탄환을 5발 묶어, 호환되는 리볼버에 빠르게 재장전할 수 있습니다."

#: data/mods/exotic_ammo/magazine/545x39.json
msgid "AK-74M magazine"
msgid_plural "AK-74M magazines"
msgstr[0] "AK-74M 탄창"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'AK-74M magazine'}
#: data/mods/exotic_ammo/magazine/545x39.json
msgid ""
"A standard magazine made for the AK-74M rifle, made of steel-reinforced "
"polymer.  Holds 30 rounds."
msgstr "AK-74M 소총에 사용되는 강화 폴리머로 만든 표준 탄창. 30발이 들어갑니다."

#: data/mods/exotic_ammo/magazine/545x39.json
msgid "AK-74M extended magazine"
msgid_plural "AK-74M extended magazines"
msgstr[0] "AK-74M 확장탄창"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'AK-74M extended magazine'}
#: data/mods/exotic_ammo/magazine/545x39.json
msgid ""
"A 45-round magazine compatible with the AK-74M rifle, though originally "
"designed for the RPK-74 light machine gun."
msgstr "AK-74M이랑 호환되는 45발들이 탄창으로, 원래 RPK-74 경기관총용으로 제작되었던 탄창입니다."

#: data/mods/exotic_ammo/magazine/57.json
msgid "FN-57 magazine"
msgid_plural "FN-57 magazines"
msgstr[0] "FN-57 탄창"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'FN-57 magazine'}
