msgstr "부활 닻 (설치됨)"

#. ~ Description for Resurrection anchor (deployed)
#: data/mods/resurrection_mod/furniture.json
msgid ""
"A resurrection anchor, functioning as a spot for resurrection, the further "
"away you are, the harder it is to bring everything back."
