msgstr "공간이동 닻 (설치됨)"

#. ~ Description for Teleporter anchor (deployed)
#: data/mods/teleportation_mod/furniture.json
msgid "A teleporter anchor, functioning as a target you can teleport to."
msgstr "공간이동시 도착지점 역할을 하는 공간이동 닻입니다."

#: data/mods/teleportation_mod/furniture.json
