msgid "No items detected at: LOADING BAY."
msgstr "적재소에 탐지된 물품 없음."

#: src/computer_session.cpp
msgid "Conveyor belt cycle complete.  Press any key…"
msgstr "컨베이어 벨트 작동 완료. 아무 키를 누르세요..."

#: src/computer_session.cpp
msgid "Toggling shutters.  Press any key…"
msgstr "셔터 작동 중. 아무 키를 누르세요..."

#: src/computer_session.cpp
msgid "Operation irreversible.  Extract radioactive material?"
msgstr "이 동작은 되돌릴 수 없습니다. 방사성 물질을 추출합니까?"

#: src/computer_session.cpp
msgid "Extraction sequence complete…  Press any key."
msgstr "추출 시퀀스 완료... 아무 키를 누르세요."

#: src/computer_session.cpp
msgid "ERROR!  Radiation platform unresponsive…  Press any key."
msgstr "오류! 방사능 플랫폼 응답없음... 아무 키를 누르세요."

#: src/computer_session.cpp
msgid "Initiating POWER-DIAG ver.2.34…"
msgstr "동력-진단기 ver.2.34 기동 중..."

#: src/computer_session.cpp
msgid "Short circuit detected!"
msgstr "단선된 회로가 탐지되었습니다!"

#: src/computer_session.cpp
msgid "Short circuit rerouted."
msgstr "단선된 회로를 우회하였습니다."

#: src/computer_session.cpp
msgid "Fuse reset."
msgstr "퓨즈가 재설정되었습니다."

#: src/computer_session.cpp
msgid "Ground re-enabled."
msgstr "그라운딩이 재승인되었습니다."

#: src/computer_session.cpp
#, c-format
msgid "Internal power lines status: 85%% OFFLINE.  Reason: DAMAGED."
msgstr "내부 전력 계통 상태: 85%% 오프라인. 사유: 불명."

#: src/computer_session.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"External power lines status: 100%% OFFLINE.  Reason: NO EXTERNAL POWER "
"DETECTED."
msgstr "외부 전력 계통 상태: 100%% 오프라인. 사유: 외부 전력 탐지되지 않음."

#: src/computer_session.cpp
msgid "Backup power status: STANDBY MODE."
msgstr "비상 전력 상태: 대기 모드."

#: src/computer_session.cpp
msgid "Backup power status: OFFLINE.  Reason: UNKNOWN"
msgstr "비상 전력 상태: 오프라인. 사유: 불명."

#: src/computer_session.cpp
msgid "The console shuts down."
msgstr "콘솔이 작동을 멈췄습니다."

#: src/computer_session.cpp
msgid "Manhacks drop from compartments in the ceiling."
msgstr "맨핵이 천장칸에서 떨어졌습니다."

#: src/computer_session.cpp
msgid "Secubots emerge from compartments in the floor."
msgstr "보안로봇이 방 바닥에서 올라왔습니다."

#: src/computer_session.cpp
msgid "The console shocks you."
msgstr "콘솔에 감전되었습니다."

#: src/computer_session.cpp
msgid "You're protected from electric shocks."
msgstr "감전으로부터 보호되었습니다."

#: src/computer_session.cpp
msgid "Your body is damaged by the electric shock!"
msgstr "감전되어 피해를 입었습니다!"

#: src/computer_session.cpp
msgid "The pump explodes!"
msgstr "펌프가 폭발했습니다!"

#: src/computer_session.cpp
msgid "Sewage leaks!"
msgstr "하수가 새기 시작합니다!"

#: src/computer_session.cpp
msgid "ERROR: Disruptive Spin"
msgstr "오류: 회전을 방해받음."

#: src/computer_session.cpp
msgid "ERROR: Please use blood-contained samples."
msgstr "오류: 혈액이 포함된 샘플을 사용해 주세요"

#: src/computer_session.cpp
msgid "ERROR: Blood draw kit, empty."
msgstr "오류: 채혈기, 비어있음."

#: src/computer_session.cpp
msgid "ERROR: Blood sample destroyed."
msgstr "오류: 혈액 샘플이 파괴되었습니다."

#: src/computer_session.cpp
msgid "ERROR: ACCESSING DATA MALFUNCTION"
msgstr "오류: 데이터 접근 오작동"

#: src/computer_session.cpp
msgid "ERROR: Data bank destroyed."
msgstr "오류: 데이터 저장소가 파괴되었습니다."

#: src/computer_session.cpp
msgid "SEARCHING FOR NEAREST REFUGEE CENTER, PLEASE WAIT…"
msgstr "가까운 피난시설 검색 중. 잠시만 기다리십시오..."

#. ~555-0164 is a fake phone number in the US, please replace it with a number
#. that will not cause issues in your locale if possible.
#: src/computer_session.cpp
#, c-format
msgid ""
"\n"
"REFUGEE CENTER FOUND!  LOCATION: %d %s\n"
"\n"
"IF YOU HAVE ANY FEEDBACK CONCERNING YOUR VISIT PLEASE CONTACT\n"
"THE DEPARTMENT OF EMERGENCY MANAGEMENT PUBLIC AFFAIRS OFFICE.\n"
"THE LOCAL OFFICE CAN BE REACHED BETWEEN THE HOURS OF 9AM AND\n"
"4PM AT 555-0164.\n"
"\n"
"IF YOU WOULD LIKE TO SPEAK WITH SOMEONE IN PERSON OR WOULD LIKE\n"
"TO WRITE US A LETTER PLEASE SEND IT TO…\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"피난시설 확인됨! 위치: %d%s\n"
"\n"
"방문에 관해 불만 또는 문의사항이 있다면\n"
"비상관리공무처에 연락해주세요.\n"
"지역 사무실은 오전 9시부터 오후 4시까지 운영되며\n"
"555-0164로 연락하실 수 있습니다.\n"
"\n"
"직접 대면하여 논의하고 싶거나 편지를 보내고 싶다면\n"
"다음 주소로 보내주십시오…\n"

