#. ~ This is a string to construct the item name as it is displayed. This
#. format string has been added for maximum flexibility. The strings are:
#. %1$s: Damage text (e.g. "bruised"). %2$s: burn adjectives (e.g. "burnt").
#. %3$s: tool modifier text (e.g. "atomic"). %4$s: vehicle part text (e.g.
